{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wieslawsoltes/SharpForge/pulls/4536","id":4734335841,"node_id":"PR_kwDOU59Ms88AAAABGjA7YQ","html_url":"https://github.com/wieslawsoltes/SharpForge/pull/4536","diff_url":"https://github.com/wieslawsoltes/SharpForge/pull/4536.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/wieslawsoltes/SharpForge/pull/4536.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wieslawsoltes/SharpForge/issues/4536","number":4536,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"SF-A21: reject malformed LSP envelopes before dispatch","user":{"login":"wieslawsoltes","id":2297442,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyOTc0NDI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2297442?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wieslawsoltes","html_url":"https://github.com/wieslawsoltes","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wieslawsoltes/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wieslawsoltes/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wieslawsoltes/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wieslawsoltes/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wieslawsoltes/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wieslawsoltes/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wieslawsoltes/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wieslawsoltes/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wieslawsoltes/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Task: SF-A21-T05\nProject 4 prerequisite for SF-A29-T05.6 / #1148.\n\n## Problem and behavior\nThe public LanguageServer adapter destructured input before its error boundary. Null and undefined threw, primitive values could look like notifications, and arrays carrying request properties could enter dispatch and change server state.\n\nReject non-object values and arrays before destructuring or dispatch with JSON-RPC -32600, null ID, and the stable Invalid Request diagnostic. Keep normal object requests, IDs, optional jsonrpc, notifications, initialization capabilities and shutdown semantics. Existing token and symbol wire constants move unchanged into a small internal module; the frozen lsp.js file shrinks. Full method/parameter validation remains separate.\n\n## Changes outside A29\nThis is a minimal A21 product fix required by actual protocol fuzzing, plus its public-adapter tests and A21 manifest registration. Live A21 claim-ref lookup returned no matching refs before this edit. DAP and reserved DAP-owner paths are untouched.\n\n## Validation\n- Before fix: 17 of 19 new LSP regressions failed at parent source 055b6484; the two unaffected cases passed.\n- After fix: all 30 new and existing protocol tests passed.\n- Command: `node scripts/limited.js node --test --test-concurrency=1 --test-reporter=tap tests/protocol-lsp-envelope.test.js tests/protocol.test.js`.\n- Node 24.19.0, Linux x64; local tested commit `624291c6156befe7a2f07488eca475b575824cff`, tested tree `3721429d4b9e49d246d46551f1a0d1fe498fecc4`.\n- Published tree verified byte-identical to that tested tree; GitHub-created commit metadata differs.\n- Independent source review passed. Ordinary core is static/build verification and does not run Node tests.\n\nNo issue is closed by this PR; broader protocol-client and platform qualification remains open.","created_at":"2026-10-04T12:25:04Z","updated_at":"2026-10-04T12:26:12Z","closed_at":"2026-10-04T12:26:12Z","merged_at":"2026-10-04T12:26:12Z","merge_commit_sha":"a15f7c3dddc34434968489d8ce8eb19f2af90022","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[{"id":12526353617,"node_id":"LA_kwDOU59Ms88AAAAC6qD80Q","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wieslawsoltes/SharpForge/labels/size/L","name":"size/L","color":"A14C05","default":false,"description":null,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wieslawsoltes/SharpForge/p